# Data, checkpoints, exports -- large/regenerable, never committed.
# Regenerate with: uv run python scripts/prepare_data.py && uv run python src/train.py
# Keep only canonical evidence sets. Older local runs stay on disk but do not
# enter the submission and cannot conflict with protocol-v2 documentation.
data/*
checkpoints/*
experiments/*
